// Terminals shared by byte-stream grammars (one latin-1 character per byte).
// A tracker grammar loaded through pysidtracker.bytegrammar.ByteGrammar takes
// them with:
//
//     %import bytes (BYTE, _TAIL)
//
// BYTE is any one byte; _TAIL is the run of bytes stored after a stream's
// terminator, which the player never reads through that stream's pointer.

BYTE: /[\x00-\xff]/
_TAIL: /[\x00-\xff]+/
